      "instructions": [
        "P1 controls Scenario Dragon and four Islands; cast Draconic Lore (normally {5}{U})."
      ],
      "expectedOutcome": "Draconic Lore is castable for {3}{U} and resolves: P1 draws Scenario Ant, Bee and Cat.",
